WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.960
When the agent says it's finished, you can
make a test run part of that decision.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.022
You ask it to build the plan and
run npm test before finishing.

3
00:00:12.022 --> 00:00:14.443
Its first attempt fails the test.

4
00:00:14.443 --> 00:00:17.745
Until gives it another
turn with the failure.

5
00:00:17.745 --> 00:00:21.560
The agent fixes the code,
and the second run passes.

6
00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:30.062
Pick the check that covers
the behaviour you need.

7
00:00:30.062 --> 00:00:33.353
Until gives the agent a
way to prove it locally.
